#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 1 3 2024) EQUALS `not after the day of the accident`
#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) EQUALS `the first entitlement period (weeks 1 to 13)`
#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 31 5 2024) EQUALS `the first entitlement period (weeks 1 to 13)`
#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 1 6 2024) EQUALS `the second entitlement period (weeks 14 to 78)`
#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 29 8 2025) EQUALS `the second entitlement period (weeks 14 to 78)`
#ASSERT `Which entitlement period is this day in` `A` (`d` 30 8 2025) EQUALS `after the second entitlement period (after week 78)`

§§ `weekly payments -- am I entitled for this day`

-- A helper over the exported question: the Part 3 gate passes (role "neither", so s 3.36 never bites), the accident is
-- `A`, and the rest varies. Arguments: the day; earner; loss; age on the day; fault %; only threshold injuries; damages
-- claim pending; physical %; psychological %; retiring-age day; outside Australia; permanent loss found and identity
-- established; damages recovered; claim day; explanation for a late claim (Regulation cl 8A); suspended; 2022
-- amendments apply.
GIVEN `w day` IS A DATE, `w earner` IS A BOOLEAN, `w loss` IS A BOOLEAN, `w age` IS A NUMBER, `w fault` IS A NUMBER
      `w threshold` IS A BOOLEAN, `w pending` IS A BOOLEAN, `w physical` IS A NUMBER, `w psychological` IS A NUMBER
      `w retiring` IS A DATE, `w outside` IS A BOOLEAN, `w permanent` IS A BOOLEAN, `w recovered` IS A BOOLEAN
      `w claim` IS A DATE, `w explained` IS A BOOLEAN, `w suspended` IS A BOOLEAN, `w amended` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`weekly` MEANS
    `Am I entitled to weekly payments for this day` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `neither` `w fault` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `A` `w day` `w earner` `w loss` `w age` `w threshold` `w pending` `w physical` `w psychological` `w retiring` `w outside` `w permanent` `w permanent` `w recovered` `w claim` `w explained` `w suspended` `w amended`

-- The ordinary claimant: earner, loss, 40, no fault, claimed 15 March 2024, retiring age in 2050.
GIVEN `o day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`ordinary` MEANS `weekly` `o day` TRUE TRUE 40 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `ordinary` (`d` 2 3 2024) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `ordinary` (`d` 1 3 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not an earner in the first 78 weeks: NOTHING (fork F8). After week 78: an adult, yes; under 18, no; an earner under 18, yes.
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 2 3 2024) FALSE TRUE 40 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 30 8 2025) FALSE TRUE 40 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 30 8 2025) FALSE TRUE 17 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 30 8 2025) TRUE TRUE 17 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No loss: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 2 3 2024) TRUE FALSE 40 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 3.11: 62% at fault -- day 364 yes, day 365 no; 61% day 365 yes; threshold injuries only, day 365 no.
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 28 2 2025) TRUE TRUE 40 62 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 1 3 2025) TRUE TRUE 40 62 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 1 3 2025) TRUE TRUE 40 61 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `weekly` (`d` 1 3 2025) TRUE TRUE 40 0 TRUE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
