#ASSERT `Am I entitled to weekly payments for this day` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE `neither` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `A` (`d` 2 4 2024) TRUE TRUE 40 FALSE FALSE 0 0 (`d` 1 1 2050) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 15 3 2024) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `weekly payments -- how much`

-- Arguments: accident; a day in the week; pre-accident weekly earnings; pre-accident earning capacity; post-accident
-- earning capacity; post-accident earnings; maximum; contributory negligence %; 2022 amendments apply. The minimum is
-- 2.5% of the maximum (Regulation cl 7): 2.5% of 3853 = 96.325.
-- First period: 95% of 1000 = 950.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 950
-- 95% of 5000 = 4750, capped at 3853.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 5000 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 3853
-- Just over and just under the cap: 95% of 4056 = 3853.20 -> 3853; 95% of 4055 = 3852.25.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 4056 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 3853
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 4055 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 3852.25
-- The greater of capacity 500 and earnings 300 is taken: 95% of 1500 = 1425.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 2000 1200 500 300 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 1425
-- Second period: total loss 80% of 1000 = 800; partial (earning 400) 85% of 600 = 510.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 6 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 800
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 6 2024) 1000 1200 0 400 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 510
-- After week 78: from pre-accident earning capacity, 80% of 1200 = 960; with 25% contributory negligence, 720.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 30 8 2025) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 960
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 30 8 2025) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 TRUE EQUALS JUST 720
-- s 3.38(1): no reduction within 52 weeks (day 92, day 364); from day 365, 800 x 75% = 600.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 6 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 TRUE EQUALS JUST 800
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 28 2 2025) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 TRUE EQUALS JUST 800
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 3 2025) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 TRUE EQUALS JUST 600
-- Before the 2022 amendments: day 182, 800; day 183 NOTHING; day 365, 600.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 30 8 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 FALSE EQUALS JUST 800
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 31 8 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 3 2025) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 25 FALSE EQUALS JUST 600
-- The floor (s 3.6(4)): earnings 1000, now earning 900 -- 95% of 100 = 95, raised to the minimum 96.325 (finding 4).
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 1000 1200 0 900 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 96.325
-- The floor is the lesser of the minimum and the pre-accident earnings: earnings 50 -- 95% = 47.50, raised to 50.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 50 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 50
-- Floor 96.325 above the ceiling 3853 - 3800 = 53: NOTHING (fork F10).
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 4000 1200 0 3800 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- No loss; the accident day.
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 2 3 2024) 1000 1200 0 1000 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `How much is my weekly payment` `A` (`d` 1 3 2024) 1000 1200 0 0 3853 0 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

