§§ `Division 3.4 -- treatment and care`

-- A helper: the gate's other facts pass (role "neither"), accident `A`. Arguments: expense; under 18 or needs help;
-- reasonable and necessary; related; verified; accords with the Guidelines; day incurred; age at accident; fault %;
-- threshold only; paid under damages or bulk billing; LTCS participant; outside Australia; citizen or PR; workers
-- compensation payable; workers compensation medical stopped; 2022 amendments apply.
GIVEN `t expense` IS A `The treatment and care expense`, `t help` IS A BOOLEAN, `t reasonable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `t related` IS A BOOLEAN, `t verified` IS A BOOLEAN, `t accords` IS A BOOLEAN, `t day` IS A DATE
      `t age` IS A NUMBER, `t fault` IS A NUMBER, `t threshold` IS A BOOLEAN, `t paid` IS A BOOLEAN
      `t lifetime` IS A BOOLEAN, `t outside` IS A BOOLEAN, `t citizen` IS A BOOLEAN, `t workers comp` IS A BOOLEAN
      `t medical stopped` IS A BOOLEAN, `t amended` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`care` MEANS
    `Can I get statutory benefits for this treatment and care expense` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE `t workers comp` `neither` `t fault` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `t expense` `t help` `t reasonable` `t related` `t verified` `t accords` `A` `t day` `t age` `t threshold` `t paid` `t lifetime` `t outside` `t citizen` `t medical stopped` `t amended`

`cost` MEANS `the cost of treatment and care`

#ASSERT `care` `cost` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2024) 40 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
